      "isPinned": true,
      "content": "@everyone \uD83D\uDCE2 LibreLane Update!\n\nThis update includes important changes to LibreLane, as well as some general PDK updates. Below is a list of the most noteworthy changes.\n\n- PDK [`2fdf40d5`](https://github.com/fossi-foundation/open-pdks/commit/2fdf40d5736413bb321c31418462aefc17b919b8)\n  - Update magic and netgen tech files\n  - Update `gf180mcu_ocd_sc_rt12t3v3` to latest\n  - Update gf180mcu_as_sc_mcu7t3v3 to latest\n  - Fix RC constants (resistance unit mismatch of 1e3): https://github.com/fossi-foundation/open-pdks/pull/582\n\n- Project Template [1.6.1](https://github.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-project-template/releases/tag/1.6.1)\n  - Update PDK to 2fdf40d5\n  - Update LibreLane\n    - Fix SPEF annotation of macros: https://github.com/librelane/librelane/issues/1075\n\n- Precheck [1.8.1](https://github.com/wafer-space/gf180mcu-precheck/releases/tag/1.8.1)\n  - Update PDK to 2fdf40d5\n  - Add more layer checks to prevent surprises later on (`ESD`, `FuseWindow_D`, `POLYFUSE`, `GUARD_RING_MK`)\n\nDespite the unit mismatch in the RC constants, there were no significant changes to the LibreLane CI metrics.\nNote that the final parasitics for post-pnr STA are extracted using OpenRCX and were not affected by this mismatch.\n\nPlease let me know if there are any questions.",
